# Source asset archives and Blender sources stay local.
# Both packs are CC0 so republishing is permitted; we decline as a courtesy
# to KayKit (the SOURCE tier is a paid download) and to keep the repo lean.
# The source archives and Blender files stay local. Runtime assets live in
# src/island/public/ instead, which also avoids a case collision with this
# folder on case-insensitive Windows vs case-sensitive Linux CI.
Assets/*.zip
Assets/**/*.blend
Assets/**/*.blend1
# Same courtesy for KayKit's own promotional renders, kept locally as the
# art-direction reference the island is being built towards.
Assets/style/
